---
import heroImage from '../assets/hero-bg.png';
---

<section 
  id="home"
  class="relative min-h-[calc(100vh-88px)] flex items-center overflow-hidden px-4 py-24"
  style={`background-image: url(${heroImage.src}); background-size: cover; background-position: center;`}
>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(6,23,43,0.94),rgba(10,34,64,0.78),rgba(10,34,64,0.38))]"></div>
  <div class="absolute -right-24 top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-orange-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-20 left-1/3 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="container relative z-10 mx-auto grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl text-center lg:text-left">
      <p class="section-eyebrow justify-center lg:justify-start">Aduanas Anachi</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black leading-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl" style="color: var(--color-white);">
        Gestión aduanera ágil para mercancías que no pueden esperar.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 sm:text-xl lg:mx-0 mx-auto" style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);">
        Especialistas en alimentación, bebidas y REA en Canarias. Más de 30 años resolviendo importaciones, exportaciones e inspecciones con criterio experto y trato cercano.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row lg:justify-start justify-center">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary text-base uppercase tracking-wide py-4 px-8">
          Habla con un Experto
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#services" class="rounded-full border border-white/25 px-8 py-4 font-bold text-white transition hover:border-white/70 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white hover:no-underline">
          Ver servicios
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="surface-card accent-ring hidden rounded-[2rem] p-6 lg:block">
      <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] p-8" style="background-color: var(--color-primary-dark);">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Operativa segura</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-white);">Canarias, UE y terceros países bajo control.</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/10 p-5 text-white backdrop-blur">
            <strong class="block text-4xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-accent-orange);">30+</strong>
            <span>Años de experiencia aduanera</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/10 p-5 text-white backdrop-blur">
              <strong class="block text-3xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-accent-orange);">OEA</strong>
              <span>Operador autorizado</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/10 p-5 text-white backdrop-blur">
              <strong class="block text-3xl font-black" style="color: var(--color-accent-orange);">REA</strong>
              <span>Especialización clave</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
